tion of the plane that passes though the point $Q({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})$ and is perpendicular to the vector $n$ can be given as\n\n$$\n(r-q)\\cdot n=0,\n$$\n\nwhere $r$ is the position vector of any point on the plane, and $q$ is the position vector of $Q.$\n\nSo, we have \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-q)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n-q\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n & =q\\cdot n \\\\ r\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ r\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} & =-9.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186304818 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "557e38a7-a029-588d-bfe3-065970b42e29" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "r\\cdot (i-\\sqrt{3}j+4k)=8i+\\sqrt{27}j" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186302983} {:answer/id #uuid "7b5e4122-6bcd-5d0f-81a6-b8727f7f80bf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "r\\cdot (i-\\sqrt{3}j+4k)=1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303218} {:answer/id #uuid "dcdc9b30-9726-5982-8b3e-a81f38639057" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "r\\cdot (8i+\\sqrt{27}j)=i-\\sqrt{3}j+4k" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303836} {:answer/id #uuid "f1d19671-a68e-5384-b817-7d3c1d7cbc20" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "r\\cdot (8i+\\sqrt{27}j)=-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303975} {:answer/id #uuid "fc41c2f2-2231-5ddb-adb6-644582d77c1a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "r\\cdot (8i+\\sqrt{27}j)=8-\\sqrt{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186304038}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "r\\cdot (8i+\\sqrt{27}j)=-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186303975} :answer-field/id #uuid "39ef42cb-e415-5101-9065-d75c9c30b48d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186304232}] :question/id #uuid "cd3baba0-1430-5e29-b123-dd1e840723b6" :question/math-academy-id "q-33035" :question/problem "Find an equation of the plane that contains the point  $P(1,-\\sqrt{3},4)$ and is perpendicular to the vector $n=8i+\\sqrt{27}j.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we note that the position vector of $P$ is $p=i-\\sqrt{3}j+4k$ and $n=8i+\\sqrt{27}j$ is normal to the plane.\n\nThe equation of the plane that passes through the point $P({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})$ and is perpendicular to the vector $n$ can be given as \n\n$$\n(r-p)\\cdot n=0,\n$$\n\nwhere $r$ is the position vector of any point on the plane, and $p$ is the position vector of $P.$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-p)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n-p\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n & =p\\cdot n \\\\ r\\cdot (8i+\\sqrt{27}j) & =(i-\\sqrt{3}j+4k)\\cdot (8i+\\sqrt{27}j) \\\\ r\\cdot (8i+\\sqrt{27}j) & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186308388 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4e83df31-2c2f-5620-ba52-0af831585f03" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "r\\cdot ⟨2,2,3⟩=16" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186305915} {:answer/id #uuid "56e9dbad-4aa4-533d-963c-c3233bd4192a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "r\\cdot ⟨2,3,3⟩=4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186305992} {:answer/id #uuid "86d531b8-9f38-5a61-8811-e6860c0e2231" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "r\\cdot ⟨3,2,2⟩=16" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306437} {:answer/id #uuid "a040c800-92fb-5a68-91ae-9da594b3ac2a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "r\\cdot ⟨2,3,3⟩=⟨3,2,2⟩" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306653} {:answer/id #uuid "b1d1abf3-2fea-56e2-9c26-19018c03d820" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "r\\cdot ⟨3,3,2⟩=4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306821}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "r\\cdot ⟨2,2,3⟩=16" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186305915} :answer-field/id #uuid "64233505-d022-52c2-927b-67cce1279a7b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186307839}] :question/id #uuid "641cc290-5f71-543f-a832-4e80117c9730" :question/math-academy-id "q-33312" :question/problem "Find an equation of the plane that contains the point $Q(3,2,2)$ and is perpendicular to the vector $n=⟨2,2,3⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that the position vector of $Q$ is $q=⟨3,2,2⟩,$ $n=⟨2,2,3⟩$ is normal to the plane.\n\nThe equation of the plane that passes though the point $Q({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})$ and is perpendicular to the vector $n$ can be given as\n\n$$\n(r-q)\\cdot n=0,\n$$\n\nwhere $r$ is the position vector of any point on the plane, and $q$ is the position vector of $Q.$\n\nSo, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(r-q)\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n-q\\cdot n & =0 \\\\ r\\cdot n & =q\\cdot n \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨2,2,3⟩ & =⟨3,2,2⟩\\cdot ⟨2,2,3⟩ \\\\ r\\cdot ⟨2,2,3⟩ & =16.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186308412 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3aef8723-641e-516c-8c4a-a5d5de549a58" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "r\\cdot (5i+2j+3k)=25" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186305710} {:answer/id #uuid "9813abc0-1700-54c0-9c07-5981bf1e93ad" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "r\\cdot (5i+2j+3k)=52" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306578} {:answer/id #uuid "ba6412aa-de58-53f9-bd92-3970bea844c7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "r\\cdot (6i+5j+4k)=5i" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186306890} {:answer/id #uuid "d3ef5d7c-8f43-5fb9-88cc-0e631dbc7945" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "r\\cdot (6i+5j+4k)=52" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186307114} {:answer/id #uuid "d401246f-9f18-5c5b-9df7-2bc112841ad2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "r\\cdot (6i+5j+4k)=0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186307117}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "r\\cdot (6i+5j+4k)=52" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186307114} :answer-fie